{"hymn":"S102","parent":"E1099","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"La reina a Tu diestra","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su victoria y exaltación","syl":{"n1":"La","n2":["rei","i"],"n3":["na","t"],"n4":"a","n5":"Tu","n6":["dies","i"],"n7":["tra","t"],"n8":["Ves","i"],"n9":["ti","m"],"n10":["da","t"],"n11":["de‿o","i"],"n12":["ro‿es","m"],"n13":["tá;","t"],"n15":"Las","n16":["hi","i"],"n17":["jas","t"],"n18":"de","n19":"los","n20":["re","i"],"n21":["yes:","t"],"n22":"Tu","n23":["sé","i"],"n24":["qui","m"],"n25":["to","t"],"n26":["nup","i"],"n27":["cial.","t"],"n28":["La‿i","i"],"n29":["gle","m"],"n30":["sia","t"],"n31":"con","n32":"su","n33":["glo","i"],"n34":["ria,","t"],"n35":["I","i"],"n36":["gual","t"],"n37":"al","n38":"Rey","n40":["se","i"],"n41":["rá;","t"],"n43":"Los","n44":["san","i"],"n45":["tos,","t"],"n46":"las","n47":["mu","i"],"n48":["je","m"],"n49":["res,","t"],"n50":["Tu‿i","i"],"n51":["ma","m"],"n52":["gen","t"],"n53":["lle","i"],"n54":["va","m"],"n55":["rán.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Oh, considera, hija,","Tu‿oído‿inclina‿aquí:","Olvida‿aun tu pueblo,","Lo tuyo deja ir.","Mirando tu hermosura,","Te deseará el Rey;","Su dignidad te‿inspira","A adorarlo‿a Él."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Gloriosa es la hija;","En su morada‿está;","Brocado de‿oro viste,","Que la‿hace resaltar;","Con la naturaleza","De la gloria de Dios,","Ella en vida muestra","Su ser tan santo hoy."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Con vestidos bordados","Será llevada‿al Rey;","Con su traje de lino","Se‿exhibirá‿ante Él.","Al ser bordado Cristo","En todo nuestro ser,","Con ropas tan gloriosas,","Se nos llevará‿al Rey."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["¡Qué alegría‿y gozo","Al ver a nuestro Rey!","Siempre lo‿alabaremos,","Pues sólo digno‿es Él.","Si se‿exalta‿a la reina","O se adora‿al Rey,","En todo‿este disfrute","La gloria‿es para Él."]}]}